<title>NIGERIA: Twenty dead in Nigerian bus crash.</title>
<headline>Twenty dead in Nigerian bus crash.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 20 people died when two buses travelling to the countryside for Christmas and New Year festivities collided in Nigeria's Kano state, the Daily Times newspaper reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the accident occurred on Sunday night when the driver of one of the buses was overtaking an articulated lorry.</p>
